<section class="sec" id="home-search"><div class="wrap"><p class="eb"><b>/ SEARCH HAS CHANGED</b></p><h2 class="d wide">Search has changed. Has your website?</h2><p class="lead">Customers used to search and click through ten blue links. Now they ask ChatGPT, Gemini or Google’s AI who to hire, and get a short answer with a few names. If AI cannot clearly understand your business, those names will not include yours. We build websites AI can read, trust and quote.</p><div class="cols3" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,56px)"><div class="svc"><h3>Understood by AI.</h3><p>Every page is structured so AI can tell who you are, what you do and who you serve: clear answers, structured data and consistent details.</p></div><div class="svc"><h3>Found on Google.</h3><p>Fast, mobile-ready and technically clean, with the SEO foundations Google rewards. AI search builds on the same foundations, so we start there.</p></div><div class="svc"><h3>Chosen by visitors.</h3><p>Design and words that build trust in seconds, with one clear next step on every page: call, book or enquire.</p></div></div><p style="margin-top:34px"><a class="btn" data-nav="contact" data-track="cta_talk_with_us" href="#contact">Talk to us about your website →</a></p></div></section>

